{"tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"warranty_reserve_2006 - warranty_reserve_2005","variables":{"warranty_reserve_2006":{"value":10,"source":"source:q11n3","unit":"USD_million"},"warranty_reserve_2005":{"value":4,"source":"source:q11n4","unit":"USD_million"}},"sources":{"warranty_reserve_2006":"source:q11n3","warranty_reserve_2005":"source:q11n4"}},"message":"The reserve for product warranties was $10 million at Dec. 31, 2006 and $4 million at Dec. 31, 2005. I compute the 2005-to-2006 change as 10 - 4."}